  //   4. place a zombie spawner within aggro range; ensure difficulty >= easy and the spawner area is dark.
  // The villagers carry full iron armor + iron sword + bow + arrows (given on connect; armor-manager
  // auto-equips). Detection is the real M5 seam: the entity-spotted poll + the archer/swordsman role
  // reflexes (roles.json) make a villager engage the instant a hostile enters perception. God (godPrompt
  // below) teaches each one to author a detect-and-engage skill composing the stock primitives.

  "name": "detect-and-defend",
